# WP-DURABILITY-TRANSIENT-LOCAL interop harness ignores. The foreign peers are the committed
# interop/connext/shapes-* and interop/fastdds/shapes binaries (built elsewhere); this dir holds only
# the loopback-TL QoS config + the archived proof captures. Transient capture/decode artifacts are
# ignored; the archived proof pcaps under captures/ are kept.

# a local copy of the Fast DDS profile placed in this cwd for a run (the canonical one is fastdds-profiles.xml)
profiles.xml

# transient capture/decode artifacts
decode.txt
decode.err
tshark.err
*.out
!captures/
!captures/*.pcap
!captures/*.log
!captures/*.txt
